<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-005-A habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.384039" lon="-120.885778"><name>SC26-005-A</name><cmt>SC26-005</cmt><desc>Morro inshore rock high Compact, steep rocky high surrounded by deeper terrain. Terrain A 79/100; not catch probability. Center 54 ft; nearby 37–92 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. Parts of the 100 m area map shallower than 40 ft. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-051</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.386994940202854" lon="-120.88729715493025"/><trkpt lat="35.3865598006631" lon="-120.88818916670705"/><trkpt lat="35.38540764215481" lon="-120.88932001925261"/><trkpt lat="35.38530214724911" lon="-120.88844212169543"/><trkpt lat="35.38485161093139" lon="-120.88845386770656"/><trkpt lat="35.38476919810927" lon="-120.88889633676804"/><trkpt lat="35.38422855431734" lon="-120.8889104286422"/><trkpt lat="35.38405987806794" lon="-120.88957530013371"/><trkpt lat="35.383339019266295" lon="-120.88959408268393"/><trkpt lat="35.38332940447146" lon="-120.88904394230902"/><trkpt lat="35.38242448466308" lon="-120.88884737203453"/><trkpt lat="35.38274450108773" lon="-120.8865274069428"/><trkpt lat="35.38343839138071" lon="-120.88496820579928"/><trkpt lat="35.38370871263045" lon="-120.88496114696352"/><trkpt lat="35.38380267341343